  articleID: https://NewManilaNews/Latest
  title: War, Now.
  headliner: <b>Wadiyan Forces Launch Massive Full-Scale Assault On Neighboring Agrabaht</b>
  bodyText: "Shockwaves rattled the globe before sunrise this morning after Wadiyan
    Admiral General  Aladeen ordered tanks, missiles, and tens of thousands of troops
    across the border into neighboring Agrabah, declaring the launch of a \"special
    military operation\". \r\n"
  textBeforeUrl: 'More about this story :'
  externalLinkBodyText: 'Following months of tense troop buildups dismissed by Wadiyan
    diplomats as routine border drills, air-raid sirens wailed across the Agrabahnian
    capital of Djinistan as ballistic missiles struck airfields and military depots
    in the opening hours of the offensive. '
  hasExternalLink: 1
  customComments:
  - I haven't even graduated yet and there's a war already !
  - Agrabah has a right to exist !
  - THEY'RE STILL AT IT ?! AFTER ALL THESE CENTURIES ?!
  - "Something wicked this way comes\u2026"
